sumptions, and estimation techniques.</p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_lec06_1_pdf/index.html\">Regression Analysis Slides (PDF)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_lec06_2_pdf/index.html\">High−Yield Spread Poly Fits Slides (PDF)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_lec06_3_pdf/index.html\">High−Yield Spread Fourier Fits Slide (PDF)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/3_highyieldspreadautoregressivefits_html/index.html\">HighYieldSpreadAutoRegressivefits.html</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_lec06_4_pdf/index.html\">ETF Case Study (PDF)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_etf_casestudy_zip/index.html\">ETF Case Study (ZIP)</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"lecture-7\">Lecture 7</h3>\n\n<p>Guest Lecture with Andrew Gunstensen, Mizuho Financial Group</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"video-embed video-player-wrapper\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"show-offline alert alert-warning\" role=\"alert\">\n    \n    \n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\">\n  <path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <path d=\"M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n</svg>\n\n    \n    Viewing videos requires an internet connection\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"video-container embedded-video-container youtube-container\">\n  <video\n    id=\"video-player-RvXwSoGDYvg-4489af9cd99c9cfcaf3604520ef315a1\"\n    class=\"video-js vjs-default-skin vjs-big-play-centered vjs-ocw\"\n    controls\n    data-downloadlink = \"../../static_resources/18642-lecture-7-version-2_360p_16_9.mp4\"\n    data-transcriptlink = \"\"\n    \n  >\n      \n  </video>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<script>\n  window.handleVideoJSError = function(err) {\n    console.error('Error loading VideoJS or YouTube player:', err)\n    var youtubeVideoContainers = document.querySelectorAll('.video-container.youtube-container')\n    for (var i = 0; i < youtubeVideoContainers.length; i++) {\n      youtubeVideoContainers[i].style.display = 'none';\n    }\n\n    var fallbackContainers = document.querySelectorAll('.video-fallback-container')\n    for (var j = 0; j < fallbackContainers.length; j++) {\n      fallbackContainers[j].style.display = 'block';\n    }\n  }\n\n  try {\n      new Function(\"class X{#abc;}; 1??2; ({})?.abc\");\n  }\n  catch (e) {\n    window.handleVideoJSError(e)\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('load', function() {\n    if (window.initVideoJS) {\n      window.initVideoJS()\n    }\n  })\n</script>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"video-tab-toggle-section pointer\">\n  <div class=\"video-tab-header d-flex\">\n    \n      <span class=\"tab-title-section\">\n        \n          <a href=\"../../resources/18642-lecture-7-version-2_mp4/index.html\" aria-label=\"View video page\">\n          <i class=\"material-icons toggle md-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n<span class=\"tab-title\">View video page</span>\n\n          </a>\n        \n      </span>\n    \n    \n    \n      <div class=\"ml-auto\">\n        <button class=\"video-download-icons\" aria-label=\"Show Downloads\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n          <img class=\"video-download-icon\" src=\"/static_shared/images/videojs_download.e0dbb2cfb52d2d71ba4a.svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/>\n          <i class=\"material-icons caret-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"video-tab-download-popup hidden\">\n    \n    <div class=\"download-menu-main\">\n      <ul>\n        \n          <li>\n            <a href=\"../../static_resources/18642-lecture-7-version-2_360p_16_9.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Download video\" download>Download video</a>\n          </li>\n        \n        \n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"video-tab container collapse pr-0 \" role=\"tabpanel\">\n  <div class=\"video-tab-content-section\">\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  \n</div>\n\n<p><strong>Video description:</strong> Andrew Gunstensen, head of quantitative strategies at Mizuho in New York and MIT PhD in Geophysics, delivers an insightful and comprehensive talk on linear interest rate products, focusing on fundamentals, market structure, valuation, hedging, and electronic trading. He covers the basics of interest rates and their significance as the largest and most liquid financial markets, the transition from LIBOR to SOFR post-2008 financial crisis, and the complexities of discounting, yield curve construction, and swap valuation. </p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_lec07_pdf/index.html\">Linear Rates, Products, and Models Slides (PDF)</a></p>\n",
